---
// fig. 06 / PLATE III — the autoresearch loop, tuned against its own corpus (all shipped).
// Context groups sit on top (BENCH SUBSTRATE + CORPUS SPLIT in bench-red, COMPONENT
// REGISTRY in research-orange) feeding the loop below; the loop runs in USER-FLOW order
// ①→⑦ (ParentSampler → Proposer → run_experiment → interpret → adopt → Mutation Archive
// → daily report), the archive closing the loop back to the sampler ("parent"). Guards
// (BudgetController, Eval Sentinel) sit beside the loop, unnumbered — they watch, never
// halt. Station names + constants are the SHIPPED truth (DRAWING-SPEC "VERIFIED FACTS"):
// there is NO ExperimentRunner/PromotionGate class (one run_experiment box), adopt is
// automatic (no approval gate), and BudgetController does not enforce cost. Plate SVG at
// sm+, FlowLedger rail below sm. Marker ids p3- prefixed. Theme utilities only — the hue
// tokens (research/bench + /NN alphas) live in global.css @theme.
import FlowLedger from './FlowLedger.astro';
